#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BattleTutorial/DT_BattleTutorialSequence.DT_BattleTutorialSequence.Step_002.Text
#: /Game/BattleTutorial/DT_BattleTutorialSequence.DT_BattleTutorialSequence.Step_002.Text
msgctxt ",13C6923D4F1C979CEC8C848F691D31D2"
msgid "지금부터 기본적인 전투 방법을 알려드리겠습니다."
msgstr "Let's learn the basics of combat."

#. Key:	D00DF47149CD89599690D59C0C5438B6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BattleTutorial/DT_BattleTutorialSequence.DT_BattleTutorialSequence.Step_003.Text
#: /Game/BattleTutorial/DT_BattleTutorialSequence.DT_BattleTutorialSequence.Step_003.Text
msgctxt ",D00DF47149CD89599690D59C0C5438B6"
msgid "전투는 총 세 가지 페이즈로 구성됩니다."
msgstr "Combat consists of three phases."

#. Key:	CDD91CC6439FF90DF2847EB51D6CB40D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BattleTutorial/DT_BattleTutorialSequence.DT_BattleTutorialSequence.Step_004.Text
#: /Game/BattleTutorial/DT_BattleTutorialSequence.DT_BattleTutorialSequence.Step_004.Text
msgctxt ",CDD91CC6439FF90DF2847EB51D6CB40D"
msgid "코인 준비 페이즈\\n코인 행동 페이즈\\n보스 페이즈\\n로 구성됩니다."
msgstr "Coin Ready Phase\\nCoin Action Phase\\nBoss Phase\\nThese phases repeat each turn."

#. Key:	EA93F91E4F0F5EE0AB7565A73ADA7E93
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BattleTutorial/DT_BattleTutorialSequence.DT_BattleTutorialSequence.Step_022.Text
#: /Game/BattleTutorial/DT_BattleTutorialSequence.DT_BattleTutorialSequence.Step_022.Text
msgctxt ",EA93F91E4F0F5EE0AB7565A73ADA7E93"
msgid "아이템은 코인 행동 페이즈에 사용할 수 있습니다.\\n사용할 때마다 수량이 1개씩 줄어드는 소모품입니다."
msgstr "Items can be used during the Coin Action Phase.\\nThey are consumables: each use reduces their quantity by one."

#. Key:	8589CD1946DC0B8481366A82E4D5C0C3
