#. Key:	Warning_0
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopCoinManage/W_ShopCoinWarning.cpp(21)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopCoinManage/W_ShopCoinWarning.cpp(21)
