msgid "양면에 같은 무기를 장착할 수 없습니다."
msgstr "You cannot equip the same weapon on both sides."

#. Key:	Warning_1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopCoinManage/W_ShopCoinWarning.cpp(25)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopCoinManage/W_ShopCoinWarning.cpp(25)
msgctxt "W_ShopCoinWarning,Warning_1"
msgid "이미 같은 무기가 장착된 코인이 존재합니다."
msgstr "A coin with this weapon combination already exists."

#. Key:	Warning_2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopCoinManage/W_ShopCoinWarning.cpp(29)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopCoinManage/W_ShopCoinWarning.cpp(29)
msgctxt "W_ShopCoinWarning,Warning_2"
msgid "양면에 무기가 장착되어 있지 않습니다."
msgstr "Weapons must be equipped on both sides."

#. Key:	Warning_3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopCoinManage/W_ShopCoinWarning.cpp(33)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopCoinManage/W_ShopCoinWarning.cpp(33)
