msgid "최대 30개의 코인만 보유할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "You can own up to 30 coins."

#. Key:	Warning_4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopCoinManage/W_ShopCoinWarning.cpp(37)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopCoinManage/W_ShopCoinWarning.cpp(37)
