msgstr "Not enough gold."

#. Key:	DisplayText_019
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(102)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(102)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_019"
msgid "우선 왼쪽 하단에서 코인 슬롯 창을 연 뒤 코인 슬롯을 구매해 보세요."
msgstr "Open the coin slot panel in the bottom-left corner, then buy a coin slot."

#. Key:	DisplayText_020
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(106)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(106)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_020"
msgid "코인 슬롯은 가격에 따라 해당 슬롯에 장착되는 코인의 최대 체력이 다릅니다."
msgstr "A coin slot's price determines the maximum HP of the coins in that slot."

#. Key:	DisplayText_021
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(110)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(110)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_021"
msgid "이제 코인에 무기를 장착해 보겠습니다."
msgstr "Now let's equip a weapon on your coin."

#. Key:	DisplayText_022
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(114)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(114)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_022"
msgid "쇠파이프를 장착해 보세요."
msgstr "Try equipping the Steel Pipe."

#. Key:	DisplayText_023
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(118)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(118)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_023"
msgid "코인의 앞면에 무기가 장착되었습니다."
msgstr "A weapon is now equipped on the front of your coin."

#. Key:	DisplayText_024
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(121)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(121)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_024"
msgid "코인은 양면에 무기를 장착해야 전투에 참여할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "A coin must have weapons equipped on both sides to enter battle."

#. Key:	DisplayText_025
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(125)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(125)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_025"
msgid "코인 슬롯의 뒷면 버튼이나 오른쪽 코인을 눌러 뒷면으로 전환해 보세요."
msgstr "Click the Back button on the coin slot or the coin on the right to flip it to the back."

#. Key:	DisplayText_026
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(129)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(129)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_026"
msgid "이제 코인 뒷면에 무기를 장착할 수 있습니다.\n뒷면에 무기를 장착해 보세요."
msgstr "You can now equip a weapon on the back of your coin.\nTry equipping a weapon on the back."

#. Key:	DisplayText_027
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(133)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(133)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_027"
msgid "코인의 앞뒤에는 같은 무기를 장착할 수 없습니다.\n또한 다른 코인 슬롯과 앞뒤 무기가 중복되는 코인은 만들 수 없습니다."
msgstr "You cannot equip the same weapon on both sides of a coin.\nYou also cannot create the same front-and-back weapon combination in another coin slot."

#. Key:	DisplayText_028
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(137)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(137)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_028"
msgid "코인의 앞뒤에 무기를 장착했다면\n슬롯의 위쪽 화살표 버튼을 눌러 코인 개수를 5개로 늘려 보세요."
msgstr "Once both sides have weapons equipped,\nclick the up arrow above the slot to increase its coin count to 5."

#. Key:	DisplayText_029
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(141)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(141)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_029"
msgid "코인 개수가 1개 이상인 슬롯의 코인만 전투에 참여할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Only coins from slots with a coin count of at least 1 can enter battle."

#. Key:	DisplayText_030
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(145)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(145)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_030"
msgid "이제 전투에 도움을 주는 카드를 구매해 보겠습니다."
msgstr "Now let's buy a card to help you in battle."

#. Key:	DisplayText_031
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(153)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(153)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_031"
msgid "카드 상점에서는 카드를 구매할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "You can buy cards at the Card Shop."

#. Key:	DisplayText_032
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(157)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(157)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_032"
msgid "카드는 특정 조건을 만족할 때 강력한 효과를 냅니다."
msgstr "Cards provide powerful effects when certain conditions are met."

#. Key:	DisplayText_033
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(161)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(161)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_033"
msgid "구매한 카드는 전투가 끝나도 사라지지 않으며,\n다음 전투에서도 장착할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Purchased cards remain after battle,\nand you can equip them for your next battle."

#. Key:	DisplayText_034
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(165)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(165)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_034"
msgid "카드를 구매해 보세요."
msgstr "Try buying a card."

#. Key:	DisplayText_035
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(169)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(169)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_035"
msgid "구매한 카드는 왼쪽 하단에서 확인할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "You can find your purchased cards in the bottom-left corner."

#. Key:	DisplayText_036
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(173)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(173)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_036"
msgid "이제 구매한 카드를 장착해 보세요."
msgstr "Now try equipping the card you bought."

#. Key:	DisplayText_037
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(177)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(177)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_037"
msgid "카드는 최대 3개까지 장착할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "You can equip up to 3 cards."

#. Key:	DisplayText_038
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(181)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(181)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_038"
msgid "이제 마지막으로 아이템을 구매해 보겠습니다."
msgstr "Finally, let's buy an item."

#. Key:	DisplayText_039
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(189)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(189)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_039"
msgid "아이템은 코인 행동 턴에 사용할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Items can be used during the Coin Action Phase."

#. Key:	DisplayText_040
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(193)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(193)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_040"
msgid "아이템을 하나 선택해 구매해 보세요."
msgstr "Select an item and buy it."

#. Key:	DisplayText_041
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(197)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(197)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_041"
msgid "구매한 아이템은 왼쪽의 구매한 아이템 목록에 추가되며\n최대 3종류의 아이템을 구매할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Purchased items appear in the list on the left.\nYou can own up to 3 different types of items."

#. Key:	DisplayText_042
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(201)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(201)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_042"
msgid "왼쪽 패널에서 구매한 아이템을 판매해 보세요."
msgstr "Try selling a purchased item from the panel on the left."

#. Key:	DisplayText_043
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(205)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(205)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_043"
msgid "구매한 아이템은 같은 가격에 재판매할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "You can sell purchased items for the same price you paid."

#. Key:	DisplayText_044
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(213)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(213)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_044"
msgid "이제 상점에서 할 수 있는 모든 기능을 배웠습니다."
msgstr "You have now learned everything you can do at the shop."

#. Key:	DisplayText_045
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(217)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(217)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_045"
msgid "상점에서 구매한 코인과 슬롯은 전투가 끝나면 자동으로 정산되며,\n구매한 무기와 카드는 계속해서 사용할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Purchased coins and coin slots are automatically settled after battle.\nPurchased weapons and cards remain available for future use."

#. Key:	DisplayText_001
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(22)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(22)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_001"
msgid "상점에서는 보스 전투를 준비하고 나만의 전략을 세울 수 있습니다."
msgstr "At the shop, you can prepare for boss battles and build your own strategy."

#. Key:	DisplayText_046
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(221)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(221)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_046"
msgid "이제 실제 전투를 진행해 보겠습니다."
msgstr "Now let's move on to a real battle."

#. Key:	DisplayText_002
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(26)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(26)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_002"
msgid "전투에 직접 사용하는 무기와 코인을 구매할 수 있으며,\n전투에 도움이 되는 아이템과 카드도 구매할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "You can buy weapons and coins to use in combat,\nas well as items and cards to help you in battle."

#. Key:	DisplayText_003
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(30)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(30)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_003"
msgid "우선 상점에서 이동하는 방법을 알려 드리겠습니다."
msgstr "First, let's learn how to navigate the shop."

#. Key:	DisplayText_004
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(34)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(34)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_004"
msgid "상단의 화살표를 눌러 보세요."
msgstr "Click the arrow at the top of the screen."

#. Key:	DisplayText_005
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(38)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(38)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_005"
msgid "방금 연 상단 바의 버튼을 통해 각 상점으로 빠르게 이동할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Use the buttons on the navigation bar you just opened to quickly move between shops."

#. Key:	DisplayText_006
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(42)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(42)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_006"
msgid "상단 바뿐만 아니라 책상 위의 오브젝트를 통해서도 각 상점으로 이동할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "You can also move between shops by clicking the objects on the desk."

#. Key:	DisplayText_007
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(46)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(46)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_007"
msgid "보스 버튼이나 보스 조각상을 눌러 보스 정보 화면으로 이동해 보세요."
msgstr "Click the Boss button or the boss statue to open the boss info screen."

#. Key:	DisplayText_008
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(50)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(50)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_008"
msgid "이 곳에서는 보스의 패시브와 패턴, 기믹을 가지고 있습니다."
msgstr "Here, you can view the boss's passive ability, patterns, and gimmicks."

#. Key:	DisplayText_009
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(54)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(54)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_009"
msgid "우선 패턴, 기믹 버튼을 눌러 정보를 확인해 보세요"
msgstr "First, click a pattern or gimmick button to view its details."

#. Key:	DisplayText_010
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(58)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(58)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_010"
msgid "보스는 여러 패턴과 기믹을 가지며\n보스의 패턴, 기믹 정보를 확인해 수비 전략을 세울 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Bosses have various patterns and gimmicks.\nReview them to plan your defense."

#. Key:	DisplayText_011
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(62)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(62)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_011"
msgid "이제 패시브 버튼을 눌러 패시브 정보를 확인해 보세요"
msgstr "Now click the Passive button to view the boss's passive ability."

#. Key:	DisplayText_012
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(66)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(66)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_012"
msgid "보스마다 고유한 패시브가 있으며\n보스의 패시브를 통해 공격 전략을 세울 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Each boss has a unique passive ability.\nUse this information to plan your attacks."

#. Key:	DisplayText_013
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(70)
#: Source/Flip_Side/UI/ShopTutorialFlow.cpp(70)
msgctxt "ShopTutorialFlow,DisplayText_013"
msgid "이제 이 정보를 바탕으로 전투에 사용할 무기를 구매해 보겠습니다."
msgstr "Now let's use this information to buy weapons for battle."

#. Key:	DisplayText_014
